{"abstract":"In this paper we report on development and evaluation of a video-based mobile gaze tracker for eyewear computers. Unlike most of the previous work, our system performs all its processing workload on an Android device and sends the coordinates of the gaze point to an eyewear device through wireless connection. We propose a lightweight software architecture for Android to increase the efficiency of image processing needed for eye tracking. The evaluation of the system indicated an accuracy of 1:06 and a battery lifetime of approximate 4.5 hours.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jalaliniya, Shahram","Mardanbeigi, Diako","Sintos, Ioannis","Garcia, Daniel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382745"],"event":{"acronym":"ISWC","end":"2015-09-11","place":"Osaka, jp","start":"2015-09-07","title":"The 19th annual International Symposium on Wearable Computers","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Android","Eyewear computer","Gaze tracking","Google Glass"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"eyedroid an open source mobile gaze tracker on android for eyewear computers","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2804336","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382745","identifier":[{"id":"84962490938","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-626e19fd-e2ed-4ffb-8dbb-5bd557e73dc9"],"keyword":["Android","Eyewear computer","Gaze tracking","Google Glass"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-44D49B63C152B188578BA8E82C6BC12E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of C